# Battery charge/rest characterization: GPIO4 ON, GPIO32 ADC, divider x2
# Boot: switch OFF. START begins without an initial 30-minute wait.
# Previous run available: DUMP. It is not resumed after reset.
# START: new run (replaces saved run); first sample, then charge immediately
# STOP: switch off; STATUS: live reading; DUMP: saved CSV; HELP: commands
# AUTO ON / AUTO OFF: start by itself at power-up, for running without a PC
# ERASE: drop the saved run so an automatic start may take over
# SWITCH ON / SWITCH OFF: drive GPIO4 by hand to test the wiring
# Voltage percent is a provisional voltage index, NOT true SOC.
